{"bleveBackend.TotalDocs iterates over b.cache without holding cacheMu lock while BuildIndex writes to b.cache under lock, causing potential concurrent map iteration and map write crash": 0.9517620801925659, "Watcher goroutines in initWatcher and searchSupport.init read from event channels without checking if the channel is closed, causing nil pointer dereference panic when backend closes the stream on shutdown": 0.5652160048484802, "NewResourceServer calls s.Init(ctx) and returns on error without calling the cancel func for s.ctx, causing goroutines started during partial initialization to leak": 0.9243613481521606, "searchSupport.init starts WatchWriteEvents loop with context.Background so the index-updater goroutine will not stop when ResourceServer stops and cancels its internal ctx, causing goroutine leak": 0.8687527775764465}